sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Kubeflow SDK<br/>(workbench)
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Trainer as Trainer controller
    participant Launcher as Launcher pod<br/>universal image
    participant DNS as Cluster DNS<br/>53/UDP
    participant Worker as Worker pods<br/>sshd 2222/TCP
    participant Ext as S3 / Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over User,Ext: Flow 1: Distributed MPI TrainJob (CUDA/CPU images only)
    User->>API: Create TrainJob<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, Bearer token
    API-->>Trainer: Watch TrainJob
    Trainer->>Launcher: Create launcher pod (command overridden)<br/>ServiceAccount
    Trainer->>Worker: Create worker pods (command overridden)<br/>ServiceAccount
    Launcher->>DNS: mpirun → openshift-uid-exec.sh<br/>resolve hostfile names (wait up to 60s)
    DNS-->>Launcher: Worker IPs
    Launcher->>Worker: OpenMPI over SSH 2222/TCP<br/>Public key auth (per-job key)
    Worker->>Ext: Download datasets/models<br/>HTTPS TLS, AWS keys / HF token
    Ext-->>Worker: Artifacts
    end

    participant Browser as Browser
    participant GW as Workbench Gateway/Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Jupyter as Jupyter Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
    Note over Browser,Jupyter: Flow 2: Workbench mode
    Browser->>GW: HTTPS TLS<br/>OpenShift OAuth / platform auth
    GW->>Jupyter: HTTP 8888 (no TLS in pod)<br/>upstream-authenticated, token disabled
    Jupyter-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Browser: Response
    end

    participant Tests as tests image<br/>gotestsum
    participant RayDash as Ray dashboard Route<br/>443/TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus/Thanos Route<br/>443/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 endpoint<br/>443/TCP

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note over Tests,S3: Flow 3: E2E test execution
    Tests->>API: Create namespace, queues, RBAC, workloads<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, kubeconfig
    Tests->>RayDash: Submit RayJob / status<br/>TLS verify OFF, Bearer token
    Tests->>Prom: GPU metrics queries<br/>TLS custom CA, Bearer token
    Tests->>S3: Stage / verify artifacts<br/>TLS verify OFF, AWS access key
    end
